window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"galio","b":"masteryi","win":["Galio","Galio","Skill","Galio","Galio","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Levels 1-2","text":"Poke plus W tankiness bullies his weak autos — deny CS hard right now."},{"when":"Levels 4-5","text":"Punch into the taunt hard-locks Yi the moment his 20-second Alpha Strike is spent."},{"when":"Enemy first item","text":"Wuju Style is true and Alpha Strike physical — MR does nothing here, buy armour."},{"when":"2+ items","text":"He out-duels you now — but Highlander is slow immunity, not CC: the taunt still lands."}],"wants":{"you":["Cancel Meditate with the taunt release","CS denial with poke levels 1-2","Armour, not MR — his damage is true and physical"],"foe":["Survive lane to first item","Alpha Strike untargetable past your E","Extended true-damage duels"]},"early":"You bully Yi from the first wave — Winds of War poke and your W shield beat his weak level 1-2 autos, so run him off the wave and take a CS lead. Level 3 briefly evens as his full kit trades back, but from 4-5 Justice Punch into the taunt hard-locks him: Alpha Strike is 20 seconds at rank 1, so once he spends it he has nothing, and Hero's Entrance adds roams he cannot match.","mid":"The moment Yi finishes his first item the lane inverts — Wuju Style adds true damage and Alpha Strike is physical, so magic resist answers neither and he wins straight duels. Stop fighting him alone. Your ult reaches an ally 4000 units away, so shove the wave, roam, and bank the early lead into objectives before his second item locks the 1v1.","late":"Two-plus items Yi out-duels you cleanly — he Alpha Strikes over Justice Punch and shreds through your shields, so the solo fight is dead. Your job is teamfights: Highlander grants slow immunity, not CC immunity, so the taunt still lands the instant he commits. Meditate is a channel — the taunt or the Hero's Entrance knockup cancels it outright.","whys":["Level 1 is yours — Winds of War poke plus your W shield beat Yi's weak early autos with ease.","Level 2 stays Galio: your poke and natural tankiness keep him off the wave entirely.","Level 3 evens out — Meditate arrives on a flat 10s, and it is a channel your taunt or knockup cancels outright.","Levels 4-5 are yours: punch into the taunt hard-locks Yi, and Meditate cannot channel through a taunt.","Level 6 keeps the phase Galio's — a 4000-range ult onto an ally plus taunt lockdown beat anything he has in lane.","First item flips it to Yi: Wuju Style is true damage and Alpha Strike physical, so your MR buys nothing.","2+ items stays Master Yi — Alpha Strike is untargetable, so it goes clean through your punch and the taunt release."]});
